#!/bin/zsh
# 分享縮圖主視覺：GPT 照角色參考表（work/thumb/ref.png）畫，標題字之後用程式疊（GPT 寫中文會錯）
# 用法：zsh tools/thumbs.sh [h|v]；原圖存 work/thumb/，合成跑 python3 tools/thumb.py
cd "$(dirname $0)/.."
REF=work/thumb/ref.png
CHARS="Use the attached reference sheet: keep every character's outfit, hair, colors and proportions exactly as in the reference, do not add or change clothes or accessories. Characters: (1) the chubby man with a brown paper bag over his head with black sunglasses and exactly the same big black calligraphy Chinese character 编 printed clearly on the front of the bag as in the reference (copy it exactly, do not scribble it), blue-grey plaid short-sleeve shirt, beige shorts, white clogs; (2) the cute girl teacher with brown wavy hair, a white bunny-ear headband and a pink-and-white frilly dress with pink bows; (3) the white syringe superhero mascot with a blue needle cap, a red cape and little white arms and legs; the jack-o'-lantern monsters look like the pumpkin creature on the right of the sheet. Glossy 3D chibi figure style for the characters like the reference, rich painterly background. Every character's face and body point the same direction, nobody turns the head back over the shoulder. No text, no letters, no numbers, no logos, no watermark"
SCENE="an eye-catching Halloween mobile game key art. Night at a small old Taiwanese elementary school on a mountaintop, shown as a cut-away dollhouse cross-section with warm lit classrooms on several floors, a huge glowing full moon, deep purple and orange sky, mountains and a sea of clouds. The paper-bag man stands heroically on the ground floor swinging a jump rope in a glowing arc with chalk sticks flying from his hand; the bunny teacher cheers right beside him; the syringe superhero flies above them with his red cape streaming, diving at the monsters; a huge swarm of grinning jack-o'-lantern monsters pours in and climbs up the building wall in a big heap; bats and white bedsheet ghosts fly around, candy corn and sparkles burst through the air. Dramatic diagonal composition, strong rim light, warm orange versus cool blue"
case ${1:-all} in
  h|all) zsh tools/gen.sh work/thumb/thumb-h.png "Wide 3:2 landscape image, $SCENE. Put all the characters and action in the right 60 percent of the image; the left 40 percent is a dark, calm night sky and dark school wall left empty for a title. $CHARS" $REF ;|
  v|all) zsh tools/gen.sh work/thumb/thumb-v.png "Tall 2:3 portrait image, $SCENE. Put all the characters and action in the lower 65 percent of the image; the top 35 percent is a dark, calm night sky with the moon, left empty for a title. $CHARS" $REF ;;
esac
